TI  - INDIVIDUAL VARIABILITY OF HIGHER MENTAL FUNCTIONS IN PRESCHOOL CHILDREN WITH REGARD TO THE MATERIAL PROSPERITY OF THE FAMILY (NEUROPSYCHOLOGICAL ANALYSIS)
