TI  - Combined and sequential exposure to prenatal second hand smoke and postnatal maternal distress is associated with cingulo-opercular global efficiency and attention problems in school-age children
PY  - 2024
T2  - Neurotoxicology and Teratology
VL  - 102
C7  - 107338
DO  - 10.1016/j.ntt.2024.107338
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85188006924&doi=10.1016%2Fj.ntt.2024.107338&partnerID=40&md5=6df237a806db2d48024c79dae7e4365a
