TI  - Maternal Contingent Responsiveness Moderates Temperamental Risk to Support Adaptive Infant Brain and Socioemotional Development Across the First Year of Life
PY  - 2024
T2  - Developmental Psychology
VL  - 60
IS  - 11
SP  - 2157
