TI  - The COVID generation: the neurodevelopmental consequences of in-utero COVID-19 exposure
PY  - 2026
T2  - Brain, Behavior, and Immunity
VL  - 133
C7  - 106238
DO  - 10.1016/j.bbi.2025.106238
