TI  - The adaptive stochasticity hypothesis: Modeling equifinality, multifinality, and adaptation to adversity
PY  - 2023
T2  - Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America
VL  - 120
IS  - 42
C7  - e2307508120
DO  - 10.1073/pnas.2307508120
