TI  - Early life environmental factors associated with autism spectrum disorder symptoms in children at age 2 years: A birth cohort study
PY  - 2022
T2  - Autism
VL  - 26
IS  - 7
SP  - 1864
EP  - 1881
DO  - 10.1177/13623613211068223
