TI  - Executive functions in preschool children with moderate hyperphenylalaninemia and phenylketonuria: a prospective study
PY  - 2023
T2  - Orphanet Journal of Rare Diseases
VL  - 18
IS  - 1
C7  - 175
DO  - 10.1186/s13023-023-02764-9
