TI  - Exposure to landscape fire smoke reduced birthweight in low-and middle-income countries: Findings from a siblings-matched case-control study
PY  - 2021
T2  - eLife
VL  - 10
C7  - e69298
DO  - 10.7554/eLife.69298
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85116384139&doi=10.7554%2FeLife.69298&partnerID=40&md5=ee6c137734e8411d573826633d81934c
AD  - Institute of Reproductive and Child Health / Ministry of Health Key Laboratory of Reproductive Health and Department of Epidemiology and Biostatistics, School of Public Health, Peking University Health Science Centre, Beijing, 100191, China
AD  - Department of Health Policy, School of Health Policy and Management, Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences and Peking Union Medical College, Beijing, 100730, China
