TI  - Altered neurobehavioral white matter integrity in preterm children: A confounding-controlled analysis using the adolescent brain and cognitive development (ABCD) study
PY  - 2025
T2  - NeuroImage
VL  - 323
C7  - 121600
DO  - 10.1016/j.neuroimage.2025.121600
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-105022885011&doi=10.1016%2Fj.neuroimage.2025.121600&partnerID=40&md5=0bb93923664664a7f93e018453d749ea
