TI  - Adult Physical Function Has Roots in Early Childhood Brain Function: A Five-Decade Cohort Study
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journals of Gerontology - Series B Psychological Sciences and Social Sciences
VL  - 79
IS  - 9
C7  - gbae119
