TI  - Prenatal exposure to air pollution during the early and middle stages of pregnancy is associated with adverse neurodevelopmental outcomes at ages 1 to 3 years
PY  - 2024
T2  - Environmental Health: A Global Access Science Source
VL  - 23
IS  - 1
C7  - 95
DO  - 10.1186/s12940-024-01132-9
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85208161270&doi=10.1186%2Fs12940-024-01132-9&partnerID=40&md5=8def58566032a3f340152d39ba72c5e5
