TI  - Parenting begets parenting: A neurobiological perspective on early adversity and the transmission of parenting styles across generations
PY  - 2017
T2  - Neuroscience
VL  - 342
SP  - 120
EP  - 139
DO  - 10.1016/j.neuroscience.2015.09.029
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-84945930933&doi=10.1016%2Fj.neuroscience.2015.09.029&partnerID=40&md5=cda1e8e00ebdcac2811be37095aadd59
AD  - School of Psychology, Laval University, Quebec City, G1V 0A6, QC, Canada
AD  - Centre de recherche de l'Institut universitaire en santé mentale de Québec, Quebec City, G1J 2G3, QC, Canada
