TI  - Effect of hippocampal and amygdala connectivity on the relationship between preschool poverty and school-age depression
PY  - 2016
T2  - American Journal of Psychiatry
VL  - 173
IS  - 6
SP  - 625
EP  - 634
DO  - 10.1176/appi.ajp.2015.15081014
