TI  - Rate and Risk Factors of Early Ventriculoperitoneal Shunt Revision: A Five-Year Retrospective Analysis of a Referral Center
PY  - 2020
T2  - World Neurosurgery
VL  - 134
SP  - e505
EP  - e511
