TI  - Language exposure relates to structural neural connectivity in childhood
PY  - 2018
T2  - Journal of Neuroscience
VL  - 38
IS  - 36
SP  - 7870
EP  - 7877
DO  - 10.1523/JNEUROSCI.0484-18.2018
