TI  - Rewiring the extremely preterm brain: Altered structural connectivity relates to language function
PY  - 2020
T2  - NeuroImage: Clinical
VL  - 25
C7  - 102194
DO  - 10.1016/j.nicl.2020.102194
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85078716964&doi=10.1016%2Fj.nicl.2020.102194&partnerID=40&md5=85e10e1f373b41d5b71ef0444626ead6
AD  - Perinatal Institute, Cincinnati Children's Hospital Medical Center, United States
AD  - Department of Pediatrics, University of Cincinnati College of Medicine, United States
