TI  - Influence of a functional nutrients-enriched infant formula on language development in healthy children at four years old
PY  - 2020
T2  - Nutrients
VL  - 12
IS  - 2
C7  - 535
DO  - 10.3390/nu12020535
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85079840207&doi=10.3390%2Fnu12020535&partnerID=40&md5=1954d3cdb5f90a4001a7dafa53aae742
AD  - Department of Paediatrics, School of Medicine, University of Granada, Avda. Investigación 11, Granada, 18016, Spain
AD  - EURISTIKOS Excellence Centre for Paediatric Research, Biomedical Research Centre, University of Granada, Granada, 18016, Spain
