TI  - Model Selection Reveals the Butyrate-Producing Gut Bacterium Coprococcus eutactus as Predictor for Language Development in 3-Year-Old Rural Ugandan Children
PY  - 2021
T2  - Frontiers in Microbiology
VL  - 12
C7  - 681485
DO  - 10.3389/fmicb.2021.681485
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85108174821&doi=10.3389%2Ffmicb.2021.681485&partnerID=40&md5=6f08960efa7cf384826f42f0412b9bfa
