TI  - Konzo: a distinct neurological disease associated with food (cassava) cyanogenic poisoning
PY  - 2019
T2  - Brain Research Bulletin
VL  - 145
SP  - 87
EP  - 91
DO  - 10.1016/j.brainresbull.2018.07.001
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85049757660&doi=10.1016%2Fj.brainresbull.2018.07.001&partnerID=40&md5=40084fb1de469a84bb35c63611bc2a39
