TI  - Socioeconomic status and brain injury in children born preterm: modifying neurodevelopmental outcome
PY  - 2020
T2  - Pediatric Research
VL  - 87
IS  - 2
SP  - 391
EP  - 398
DO  - 10.1038/s41390-019-0646-7
