TI  - Effects of vitamin B12supplementation on neurodevelopment and growth in Nepalese Infants: A randomized controlled trial
PY  - 2020
T2  - PLoS Medicine
VL  - 17
IS  - 12
C7  - e1003430
DO  - 10.1371/journal.pmed.1003430
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85097038456&doi=10.1371%2Fjournal.pmed.1003430&partnerID=40&md5=082247ef4d3af0d9d593e46febeb0474
