TI  - Visual, cognitive, and language assessments at 39 months: a follow-up study of children fed formulas containing long-chain polyunsaturated fatty acids to 1 year of age.
PY  - 2003
T2  - Pediatrics
VL  - 112
IS  - 3 Pt 1
SP  - e177
