AD  - GESNOMA, Division of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery, University of Geneva Hospitals, Geneva, Switzerland
AD  - Division of Clinical Epidemiology, Department of Community Health and Medicine, University of Geneva Hospitals, Geneva, Switzerland
AD  - Infection Control Programme and WHO Collaborating Centre on Patient Safety, University of Geneva Hospitals, Geneva, Switzerland
