AD  - Hosp. for Children and Adolescents, Helsinki University Central Hospital, Helsinki, Finland
AD  - Department of Obstetrics, Helsinki University Central Hospital, Helsinki, Finland
AD  - Department of Neurology, Helsinki University Central Hospital, Helsinki, Finland
