TI  - A left cerebellar pathway mediates language in prematurely-born young adults
PY  - 2013
T2  - NeuroImage
VL  - 64
IS  - 1
SP  - 371
EP  - 378
DO  - 10.1016/j.neuroimage.2012.09.008
