TI  - Assessing lexicon: Validation and developmental data of the Picture Naming Game (PiNG), a new picture naming task for toddlers
PY  - 2012
T2  - International Journal of Language and Communication Disorders
VL  - 47
IS  - 5
SP  - 589
EP  - 602
