TI  - The incidence of epilepsy in a rural district of Vietnam: A community-based epidemiologic study
PY  - 2010
T2  - Epilepsia
VL  - 51
IS  - 12
SP  - 2377
EP  - 2383
DO  - 10.1111/j.1528-1167.2010.02699.x
